# Circom / zk-SNARK build outputs that are large and/or deterministically regenerable
# from tracked source (identity.circom) or a fixed public download URL.
# NOT ignored: build/identity.r1cs, build/identity.sym, build/identity_*.zkey,
# build/identity_final.zkey — these are the irreplaceable trusted-setup ceremony
# artifacts (contributor randomness can't be reproduced) and must be tracked.
zk-proofs/build/*.ptau
zk-proofs/build/identity_js/
zk-proofs/build/identity_cpp/
zk-proofs/build/*.wtns
zk-proofs/circuits/proof.json
zk-proofs/circuits/public.json
zk-proofs/circuits/witness.wtns

